From 277212dc61a667c0b824dfa172b02febc3185f49 Mon Sep 17 00:00:00 2001
From: Quanyang Wang <quanyang.wang@windriver.com>
Date: Thu, 25 Dec 2025 13:22:36 +0800
Subject: [PATCH] common: add cmake_minimum_required

This patch is to fix the following error:

	 CMake Error in CMakeLists.txt:
	   No cmake_minimum_required command is present.  A line of code such as

	     cmake_minimum_required(VERSION 4.2)

	   should be added at the top of the file.  The version specified may be lower
	   if you wish to support older CMake versions for this project.  For more
	   information run "cmake --help-policy CMP0000".

Upstream-Status: Pending

Signed-off-by: Quanyang Wang <quanyang.wang@windriver.com>
---
diff --git a/lib/bsp/standalone/src/common/intr/CMakeLists.txt b/lib/bsp/standalone/src/common/intr/CMakeLists.txt
index 1fc72389a2..a583bfdfd6 100644
--- a/lib/bsp/standalone/src/common/intr/CMakeLists.txt
+++ b/lib/bsp/standalone/src/common/intr/CMakeLists.txt
@@ -1,5 +1,6 @@
 # Copyright (c) 2023 Advanced Micro Devices, Inc. All Rights Reserved.
 # SPDX-License-Identifier: MIT
+cmake_minimum_required(VERSION 4.2)
 
 if (YOCTO)
 find_package(common)
